.Dd March 2, 2026
.Dt ELF_RISCV_ATTRIBUTE_COUNT 3
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm elf_riscv_attribute_count
.Nd return the number of parsed RISC-V attributes
.Sh LIBRARY
.Lb libelfobj
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In elfobj.h
.Ft size_t
.Fn elf_riscv_attribute_count "const elfobj_t *obj"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn elf_riscv_attribute_count
function returns the number of RISC-V attributes parsed from the
.Pa .riscv.attributes
section in
.Fa obj .
.Pp
If no RISC-V attribute section is present, zero is returned.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns the number of parsed attributes.
Returns 0 when no attributes are available or
.Fa obj
is NULL.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr elf_riscv_attribute_tag_at 3 ,
.Xr elf_riscv_attribute_value_at 3 ,
.Xr elfobj 3
